    "text": "Something is missing from this analysis. 36% of Mainers are registered independents (more than either Democrats or Republicans.) Many of these people will turn away from Platner upon learning he is a Nazi sympathizer. We know Democrats don't care or see it as a positive, but most Independents definitely will NOT vote for a Nazi.\nYes, also attack Platner on his abuse of women, comments about blaming women for rape, etc and pick off a few of the liberal women voters. But do NOT leave the Nazi issue on the table. Do not cede the Independents to the Democrats. Hammer away on the antisemitism and Nazi sympathies!",
